WEBVTT

00:36.220 --> 00:38.730
<b>You've improved, Mizy.</b>

00:39.080 --> 00:40.810
<b>Thank you kindly.</b>

00:40.810 --> 00:44.820
<b>I'm always so nervous
when I play with you, Uncle.</b>

00:45.100 --> 00:49.990
<b>No, I was only able to play well
because of your lead.</b>

00:49.990 --> 00:50.950
<b>Come here.</b>

00:58.610 --> 00:59.960
<b>Uncle?</b>

01:05.230 --> 01:06.460
<b>It suits you.</b>

01:07.190 --> 01:08.360
<b>Take a look.</b>

01:13.470 --> 01:15.970
<b>I've entrusted you with the Gregorio Codex.</b>

01:16.260 --> 01:18.730
<b>I heard the stars and the moon
will come to take her.</b>

01:19.080 --> 01:20.710
<b>It's a possibility.</b>

01:20.710 --> 01:24.270
<b>Well, at the very least,
something is bound to happen.</b>

01:25.920 --> 01:30.650
<b>The stars and moon are nothing more
than preludes before the sun rises.</b>

01:30.650 --> 01:33.390
<b>Still, you mustn't underestimate them.</b>

01:33.390 --> 01:35.260
<b>Especially her Star...</b>

01:35.260 --> 01:36.280
<b>Uncle.</b>

01:36.650 --> 01:39.910
<b>Do you think I'd fall behind
someone like Aliceliese?</b>

01:40.260 --> 01:42.590
<b>Knowing that clever Alice,</b>

01:42.590 --> 01:46.380
<b>she might send someone
to rescue Lady Sisbell.</b>

01:48.010 --> 01:53.180
<b>In that case, I shall prepare my finest tea
and welcome them properly.</b>

01:53.180 --> 01:55.500
<b>I'm counting on you, Mizy.</b>

01:55.500 --> 01:59.620
<b>Both as a Queen candidate
and as a Star Spirit user.</b>

02:00.480 --> 02:02.340
<b>I'm looking forward to it.</b>

02:03.510 --> 02:09.480
<b>Episode 11: Morning Star: Snow the Sun</b>

02:03.650 --> 02:08.610
<b>First of all, we Imperials have no leads 
on where Sisbell has been taken.</b>

02:08.610 --> 02:10.360
<b>So we'd like to hear your guess.</b>

02:10.860 --> 02:13.560
<b>The only place I can think of
is the Tower of Sun,</b>

02:13.560 --> 02:16.320
<b>but if it's Lord Talisman,
he might have moved her elsewhere.</b>

02:16.320 --> 02:18.330
<b>Then where?</b>

02:18.780 --> 02:20.300
<b>"Snow the Sun."</b>

02:20.300 --> 02:23.960
<b>It's a facility run by the Hydra family
on the outskirts of the Central State.</b>

02:24.310 --> 02:28.410
<b>And tomorrow, the Three Royal Families
of the Nebulis Sovereignty</b>

02:28.410 --> 02:30.590
<b>will all gather for the 'Bloodline Meeting.'</b>

02:32.260 --> 02:35.740
<b>While Lord Talisman is attending that meeting,</b>

02:35.740 --> 02:37.990
<b>you'll break into Snow the Sun.</b>

02:38.650 --> 02:43.070
<b>So our best and only chance
to rescue Sisbell is tomorrow.</b>

02:43.860 --> 02:47.110
<b>I'll return to the castle
and keep an eye on Lord Talisman.</b>

02:49.590 --> 02:52.590
<b>I'm praying for your success.</b>

02:57.540 --> 02:59.790
<b>What's wrong?
You look deep in thought.</b>

03:00.480 --> 03:03.700
<b>It's complicated for someone
in my position to say, but...</b>

03:03.700 --> 03:07.160
<b>Was it really Johaim who fought the Queen?</b>

03:11.130 --> 03:13.790
<b>It was a tall man with a greatsword.</b>

03:13.790 --> 03:18.030
<b>His hair was red, and he wore
armor combined with a coat.</b>

03:18.950 --> 03:21.470
<b>Then it must've been him...</b>

03:22.110 --> 03:23.850
<b>So what's the issue?</b>

03:24.460 --> 03:27.230
<b>About Elletear being cut down.</b>

03:27.850 --> 03:29.140
<b>What are you implying?</b>

03:29.670 --> 03:33.910
<b>Lady Elletear shielded Her Majesty
and was cut down by that man.</b>

03:34.380 --> 03:36.680
<b>Both Lady Alice and I witnessed it.</b>

03:37.450 --> 03:39.780
<b>And then she was taken away by Johaim?</b>

03:40.130 --> 03:43.660
<b>Yes. He carried her off in a state
where her life or death was uncertain.</b>

03:44.060 --> 03:48.000
<b>What's bothering me
is that 'uncertain' part.</b>

03:48.600 --> 03:50.890
<b>Huh? But her injuries were that severe...!</b>

03:50.890 --> 03:53.100
<b>It would be strange
if she didn't die instantly.</b>

03:54.710 --> 03:57.170
<b>If Johaim took her,</b>

03:57.170 --> 03:59.260
<b>then she must've been alive.</b>

03:59.260 --> 04:03.100
<b>If she'd really been cut down by a true
Saint Disciple, she would've died instantly.</b>

04:03.100 --> 04:05.350
<b>There's a major inconsistency there.</b>

04:07.240 --> 04:09.480
<b>So you think that was all an act?</b>

04:11.080 --> 04:13.090
<b>No, that's impossible.</b>

04:13.480 --> 04:15.970
<b>There's no way Lady Elletear
would fake that...</b>

04:16.930 --> 04:19.600
<b>I saw the floor soaked in blood.</b>

04:20.290 --> 04:23.240
<b>That was real... not a lie...</b>

04:23.240 --> 04:25.170
<b>There was a monster
among Hydra's assassins</b>

04:25.170 --> 04:27.740
<b>that was unfazed even when cut by a sword.</b>

04:28.160 --> 04:29.600
<b>You saw it too.</b>

04:31.830 --> 04:33.710
<b>Are you saying...</b>

04:34.020 --> 04:35.870
<b>...Lady Elletear is like that creature?</b>

04:36.510 --> 04:38.650
<b>It would explain everything, wouldn't it?</b>

04:39.720 --> 04:43.630
<b>Elletear acted as if she were cut down
and escaped the palace.</b>

04:44.590 --> 04:47.640
<b>She defected to the Empire of her own will.</b>

04:51.260 --> 04:55.560
<b>But just to be clear, Elletear's situation
has nothing to do with us.</b>

04:55.560 --> 05:00.490
<b>Our cooperation with the Sovereignty
is solely for Sisbell's rescue.</b>

05:01.070 --> 05:03.070
<b>I understand that.</b>

05:05.180 --> 05:08.460
<b>Lady Elletear's case is a matter
for the Lou family.</b>

05:10.750 --> 05:12.750
<b>This is the Hydra Academy.</b>

05:12.750 --> 05:17.090
<b>The Advanced Star Spirit Research Institute,
commonly known as Snow the Sun.</b>

05:17.090 --> 05:20.090
<b>It is a research institute that aims
to convert the Star Spirit energy</b>

05:20.090 --> 05:23.640
<b>emitted from the core of the stars into energy
that can replace electricity and gas.</b>

05:24.070 --> 05:27.970
<b>The Bloodline Meeting will be
held tomorrow at 11 a.m.</b>

05:27.970 --> 05:31.460
<b>At that same time,
you'll infiltrate Snow the Sun.</b>

05:31.460 --> 05:34.160
<b>The remnants of the Imperial Army
that attacked the Sovereignty</b>

05:34.160 --> 05:36.540
<b>are still hiding in the Central State</b>

05:36.540 --> 05:39.420
<b>and have targeted a Hydra facility
and infiltrated it.</b>

05:39.910 --> 05:42.620
<b>And Lady Sisbell just happened to be there.</b>

05:42.620 --> 05:44.340
<b>That's the story we're going with.</b>

05:46.430 --> 05:48.680
<b>These two will accompany you.</b>

05:49.420 --> 05:50.970
<b>I'm Nami Orcast.</b>

05:50.970 --> 05:53.490
<b>Pleased to meet you again.</b>

05:54.110 --> 05:55.810
<b>I'm Sistia Quo-Katz.</b>

05:56.180 --> 06:00.170
<b>I will risk my life to aid
in rescuing Lady Sisbell.</b>

06:00.620 --> 06:02.940
<b>Let me explain the two of their Star Spirits.</b>

06:03.470 --> 06:04.300
<b>Nami.</b>

06:04.300 --> 06:06.740
<b>My power is 'Fog.'</b>

06:06.740 --> 06:08.810
<b>It's faster to show you than explain.</b>

06:11.280 --> 06:12.490
<b>She disappeared?!</b>

06:12.490 --> 06:15.860
<b>Her camouflage might be faster
than the Empire's optical camouflage.</b>

06:15.860 --> 06:17.160
<b>I'm over here.</b>

06:17.160 --> 06:19.320
<b>Eek! When did you get there?!</b>

06:19.770 --> 06:22.030
<b>As you can see, it has a speed limit.</b>

06:22.030 --> 06:25.950
<b>If she runs or jumps, the camouflage drops.</b>

06:26.300 --> 06:30.470
<b>First, the moment you touch this Astral Crest,
the camouflage begins.</b>

06:33.440 --> 06:35.500
<b>Iska, over here.</b>

06:37.870 --> 06:39.630
<b>Here!</b>

06:40.110 --> 06:43.900
<b>The more people camouflaging,
the shorter the duration.</b>

06:43.900 --> 06:48.300
<b>If there are six people,
the time limit is around four hours.</b>

06:48.990 --> 06:50.680
<b>I think I get the gist of it.</b>

06:53.030 --> 06:57.000
<b>My Star Spirit, 'Echo,'
gathers and analyzes sound.</b>

06:59.950 --> 07:02.800
<b>- Oh, this is good!
- Right now, I can hear the conversation</b>

07:02.800 --> 07:05.320
<b>- By the way, where are we going tomorrow?
- of tourists on the 35th floor.</b>

07:05.810 --> 07:10.140
<b>In a quiet environment, I can hear
things from about five floors away.</b>

07:10.140 --> 07:14.460
<b>Also, my Echo can mute minor
sounds like voices or footsteps.</b>

07:14.460 --> 07:16.480
<b>Captain! Try to say...</b>

07:20.290 --> 07:23.840
<b>Because it's a power that gathers sound,</b>

07:23.840 --> 07:29.010
<b>it also prevents that sound from
spreading to the surroundings.</b>

07:29.350 --> 07:31.330
<b>Can you also silence gunshots?</b>

07:31.330 --> 07:32.880
<b>Unfortunately, no...</b>

07:32.880 --> 07:36.080
<b>Got it. We'll avoid combat
as much as possible.</b>

07:36.080 --> 07:39.020
<b>But if something does happen,
Iska's sword will have to handle it.</b>

07:39.430 --> 07:41.000
<b>That's the plan.</b>

07:42.100 --> 07:45.190
<b>Rin, Purebreds are going to attend too, right?</b>

07:45.590 --> 07:47.220
<b>It's possible.</b>

07:47.220 --> 07:49.770
<b>For example, Princess Mizerhyby.</b>

07:50.310 --> 07:53.830
<b>I'll tell you everything I know
about Hydra's forces.</b>

07:54.410 --> 07:56.370
<b>But in the end, this mission hinges on you.</b>

07:57.070 --> 07:58.710
<b>I have complicated feelings about it...</b>

07:59.130 --> 08:01.790
<b>But I trust your abilities.</b>

08:01.790 --> 08:03.590
<b>I'm counting on you to rescue Lady Sisbell.</b>

08:04.350 --> 08:06.090
<b>Um, Miss Rin?</b>

08:06.530 --> 08:07.340
<b>What is it?</b>

08:07.630 --> 08:10.390
<b>Do you know him well?</b>

08:14.080 --> 08:16.810
<b>No, I mean...
that was a slip of the tongue...!</b>

08:21.880 --> 08:24.800
<b>Pardon the interruption
during your rest, Lady Alice.</b>

08:25.340 --> 08:26.690
<b>Thank you for your hard work.</b>

08:26.690 --> 08:27.900
<b>You may come in.</b>

08:34.180 --> 08:35.710
<b>We've done all we can.</b>

08:35.710 --> 08:37.970
<b>You can focus on the meeting, Lady Alice.</b>

08:38.890 --> 08:40.140
<b>I know.</b>

08:40.650 --> 08:44.980
<b>Mother will likely be held
responsible at today's meeting</b>

08:45.390 --> 08:49.650
<b>unless we succeed in rescuing Sisbell
and uncovering Hydra's plot.</b>

08:50.180 --> 08:53.720
<b>Failure would mean
the downfall of the Lou family.</b>

08:54.180 --> 08:57.180
<b>I'm sure that Imperial swordsman
and his friends will succeed.</b>

09:08.690 --> 09:11.240
<b>Everyone, let's proceed as we planned.</b>

09:17.010 --> 09:18.020
<b>Everyone...</b>

09:18.370 --> 09:19.440
<b>...let's do this!</b>

09:39.610 --> 09:41.590
<b>Hey, Alice.</b>

09:42.230 --> 09:44.800
<b>You were absent from yesterday's meeting.</b>

09:44.800 --> 09:47.070
<b>Are you alright now?</b>

09:47.480 --> 09:48.450
<b>Yes.</b>

09:48.450 --> 09:51.580
<b>I've already reviewed
the minutes from yesterday.</b>

09:51.580 --> 09:53.570
<b>That's good to hear.</b>

09:53.570 --> 09:59.200
<b>You looked a bit tense,
so I was worried something had happened.</b>

10:00.370 --> 10:02.920
<b>Thank you for your concern.</b>

10:02.920 --> 10:06.210
<b>This kind of situation is
a first for me as well.</b>

10:06.590 --> 10:08.960
<b>He noticed from my expression...?</b>

10:08.960 --> 10:10.740
<b>No, that's not it.</b>

10:11.500 --> 10:13.590
<b>Make sure you don't push yourself too hard.</b>

10:14.030 --> 10:17.970
<b>I have a vague feeling that
they've caught on to our plan.</b>

10:19.190 --> 10:21.460
<b>Lord Talisman and Lord Mask</b>

10:21.460 --> 10:24.230
<b>are far more skilled in
conversation than I am.</b>

10:24.660 --> 10:29.300
<b>With my level of skill,
I might slip up during the discussion.</b>

10:30.250 --> 10:33.390
<b>I absolutely cannot let them find out
about the Sisbell rescue operation.</b>

10:34.040 --> 10:37.370
<b>That's why silence is my best option.</b>

10:45.010 --> 10:47.360
<b>It's nearly 11 o'clock.</b>

10:47.360 --> 10:49.380
<b>Please focus on the meeting.</b>

10:53.170 --> 10:56.090
<b>It's almost 11 o'clock.</b>

10:56.090 --> 10:58.180
<b>Shall we proceed as planned?</b>

10:58.610 --> 10:59.430
<b>Of course.</b>

11:02.430 --> 11:04.310
<b>- We will begin the Bloodline Meeting...
- The operation to rescue Lady Sisbel...</b>

11:04.310 --> 11:06.500
<b>- ...on the Imperial Army incident.
- ...commence.</b>

11:07.450 --> 11:11.270
<b>Until we rescue Sisbell,
we move in complete stealth.</b>

11:29.940 --> 11:32.840
<b>They really can't see us...</b>

11:38.740 --> 11:41.760
<b>Hurry, Captain!
The door's about to close!</b>

11:41.760 --> 11:44.420
<b>Ah, wait, Nene!</b>

11:46.450 --> 11:48.030
<b>That was close...</b>

11:48.030 --> 11:51.940
<b>Good thing we practiced
so much at the hotel yesterday.</b>

11:51.940 --> 11:54.570
<b>The only one who benefited
from that practice was you, Boss.</b>

11:54.570 --> 11:56.070
<b>Jhin!</b>

11:56.070 --> 11:58.270
<b>Don't shout, Boss.</b>

11:58.270 --> 12:00.190
<b>There's a limit to how much she can mute.</b>

12:00.570 --> 12:03.410
<b>We've only just infiltrated enemy territory.</b>

12:04.870 --> 12:09.120
<b>It really looks like
an Imperial research facility.</b>

12:09.530 --> 12:11.310
<b>These huge ducts...</b>

12:11.310 --> 12:15.510
<b>...are probably for channeling Star Spirit energy
from the underground Vortex.</b>

12:16.150 --> 12:18.490
<b>If there's this much foot traffic,</b>

12:18.490 --> 12:21.500
<b>there can't be too many places
where they could keep Sisbell confined.</b>

12:22.960 --> 12:27.320
<b>Unlike the private soldiers,
there's no way all the hundreds</b>

12:27.320 --> 12:30.810
<b>of researchers here are in on this plot.</b>

12:31.140 --> 12:35.570
<b>So that means we're looking for a place
where ordinary researchers wouldn't go?</b>

12:35.920 --> 12:39.540
<b>Most likely either the underground storage zone,
the Hydra chamber on the top floor,</b>

12:39.540 --> 12:42.600
<b>or one of the highest-level research labs.</b>

12:42.600 --> 12:44.330
<b>Captain Mismis,</b>

12:44.330 --> 12:47.290
<b>Maybe four floors below us...</b>

12:47.740 --> 12:50.080
<b>I hear faint breathing.</b>

12:51.080 --> 12:53.130
<b>Could it be that Lady Sisbell?!</b>

12:53.850 --> 12:56.090
<b>Then let's start from the basement.</b>

12:56.090 --> 12:56.730
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:58.130 --> 12:59.270
<b>Let's move.</b>

13:06.970 --> 13:08.130
<b>Your Majesty...</b>

13:08.130 --> 13:10.310
<b>I may sound harsh,</b>

13:10.310 --> 13:13.230
<b>but I must say that I am deeply
disappointed in you.</b>

13:13.730 --> 13:17.440
<b>You let the Imperial Army
infiltrate the Royal Palace.</b>

13:17.890 --> 13:20.740
<b>This is the greatest humiliation
since the founding of our nation.</b>

13:21.500 --> 13:25.490
<b>Lord Growley, head of the Zoa family,
has gone missing.</b>

13:25.800 --> 13:29.370
<b>There's no doubt that he has
been taken away by the Empire.</b>

13:30.620 --> 13:32.690
<b>Please wait, Lord On!</b>

13:32.690 --> 13:35.470
<b>Her Majesty the Queen is suffering
just as much as we are.</b>

13:35.470 --> 13:40.010
<b>Lady Elletear and Lady Sisbell
are both missing!</b>

13:41.740 --> 13:46.270
<b>Lord Mask, now is not the time for
a pointless argument over who is to blame.</b>

13:46.270 --> 13:48.810
<b>Shouldn't we be devising
a rescue plan for the missing?</b>

13:48.810 --> 13:51.460
<b>A full-scale assault on Imperial territory.</b>

13:51.460 --> 13:55.180
<b>That is the most effective
method for rescuing them.</b>

13:55.880 --> 14:00.240
<b>Do you truly believe that Lord Growley will
be returned through polite negotiations?</b>

14:00.240 --> 14:01.820
<b>The answer is no.</b>

14:01.820 --> 14:05.810
<b>Because to the Empire, the true worth of
Purebreds lies not in their value as hostages,</b>

14:05.810 --> 14:07.620
<b>but as research material.</b>

14:08.370 --> 14:09.760
<b>How do you plan to negotiate...</b>

14:09.760 --> 14:13.890
<b>...with such people who pretend not
to have committed inhumane acts...</b>

14:13.890 --> 14:16.620
<b>...against those who have been captured?</b>

14:17.000 --> 14:19.000
<b>T-That's...</b>

14:20.230 --> 14:24.010
<b>Therefore, I propose a full-scale
assault on the Empire.</b>

14:24.450 --> 14:25.760
<b>Lord Mask.</b>

14:26.250 --> 14:29.830
<b>As Queen, I cannot accept a proposal
that would result in even more sacrifices</b>

14:29.830 --> 14:32.140
<b>under these circumstances.</b>

14:33.220 --> 14:36.400
<b>With a strong leader, anything is possible.</b>

14:41.010 --> 14:42.400
<b>He has a point.</b>

14:42.400 --> 14:45.160
<b>Then we must hasten the Queen selection.</b>

14:45.160 --> 14:50.910
<b>It is a common occurrence in times of
turmoil for a new leader to emerge.</b>

14:50.910 --> 14:52.910
<b>Isn't that what you're implying?</b>

14:53.570 --> 14:54.640
<b>No.</b>

15:03.760 --> 15:06.430
<b>It's over there, just ahead.</b>

15:13.670 --> 15:15.780
<b>It's behind that storage area.</b>

15:16.150 --> 15:18.900
<b>Is Lady Sisbell really being held there?</b>

15:18.900 --> 15:21.480
<b>It might not be Lady Sisbell.</b>

15:21.480 --> 15:23.650
<b>It's only a faint presence.</b>

15:25.720 --> 15:27.400
<b>It's Sisbell's servant.</b>

15:28.100 --> 15:29.620
<b>Nene, got the photos?</b>

15:30.020 --> 15:31.990
<b>I've got all the evidence we need.</b>

15:31.990 --> 15:35.440
<b>If Shuvalts is being held here,
then maybe Lady Sisbell is too.</b>

15:35.950 --> 15:38.140
<b>There's no trace of her now.</b>

15:38.140 --> 15:40.750
<b>Maybe Lady Sisbell is not in the underground.</b>

15:41.100 --> 15:43.650
<b>Then the next suspicious place is upstairs.</b>

15:44.710 --> 15:48.140
<b>Nene, can you do something
with that security camera?</b>

15:48.720 --> 15:54.340
<b>I can, but if I jam it,
the control center will get notified.</b>

15:54.340 --> 15:56.710
<b>That means we'll be exposed.</b>

15:56.710 --> 15:59.140
<b>Then we'll leave him for now.</b>

15:59.140 --> 16:00.610
<b>Right, Boss?</b>

16:01.220 --> 16:05.860
<b>It might sound cold, but saving
Lady Sisbell is our priority.</b>

16:06.920 --> 16:08.540
<b>Understood.</b>

16:11.710 --> 16:14.350
<b>Let's go as high up as we can.</b>

16:17.530 --> 16:22.570
<b>Listen, everyone.
Our mission is to rescue Sisbell.</b>

16:22.570 --> 16:24.880
<b>Until then, no matter who shows up,</b>

16:25.350 --> 16:27.760
<b>do not get spotted!</b>

16:40.320 --> 16:41.650
<b>That person...!</b>

16:43.650 --> 16:45.090
<b>Jhin!</b>

16:45.880 --> 16:49.030
<b>She didn't come here to catch us.</b>

16:49.540 --> 16:51.720
<b>She just got on the elevator.</b>

17:06.030 --> 17:07.690
<b>We can use her.</b>

17:31.130 --> 17:33.220
<b>Is something wrong, Lady Grugell?</b>

17:33.980 --> 17:37.440
<b>I feel like I've been bugged for a while...</b>

17:37.440 --> 17:40.000
<b>But it was probably just my imagination.</b>

18:04.300 --> 18:06.520
<b>Nami, how much time do we have left?</b>

18:06.910 --> 18:09.230
<b>About an hour, I think.</b>

18:23.060 --> 18:24.990
<b>It's strangely quiet.</b>

18:24.990 --> 18:27.670
<b>Yeah, so quiet that it's actually creepy.</b>

18:28.150 --> 18:30.480
<b>Where's Lady Sisbell?</b>

18:30.480 --> 18:34.550
<b>There's no sign of Lady Sisbell on this floor.</b>

18:36.070 --> 18:38.430
<b>Then where is she?</b>

18:38.430 --> 18:42.390
<b>I can hear a single person's
breathing from the floor above.</b>

18:42.730 --> 18:44.720
<b>There's no sign of movement,</b>

18:44.720 --> 18:48.730
<b>so they're either restrained
or sitting in a chair.</b>

18:48.730 --> 18:50.980
<b>Then it might really be Lady Sisbell...</b>

18:51.600 --> 18:54.710
<b>First, we need a way to
infiltrate the top floor.</b>

18:54.710 --> 18:58.330
<b>We can worry about whether it's
Sisbell up there or not afterward.</b>

18:58.670 --> 19:03.330
<b>But how do we get up there?
There wasn't an elevator, right?</b>

19:03.640 --> 19:06.960
<b>There must be some kind of
mechanism on this floor.</b>

19:07.970 --> 19:09.590
<b>As I thought.</b>

19:10.100 --> 19:12.110
<b>They really are messing with us.</b>

19:12.110 --> 19:14.220
<b>Hmm? The door's left wide open?</b>

19:15.000 --> 19:16.630
<b>I'll go first.</b>

19:21.140 --> 19:24.350
<b>Iska?! Will you be okay?!</b>

19:24.690 --> 19:26.780
<b>Of course. I'll proceed with caution.</b>

19:29.360 --> 19:30.540
<b>Is it a trap?</b>

19:30.930 --> 19:34.760
<b>But if it is, why would they
invite us to the top floor?</b>

19:38.170 --> 19:41.690
<b>Oh? Granny Grugell.</b>

19:42.940 --> 19:44.700
<b>Vichyssoise, is that you?</b>

19:44.700 --> 19:48.390
<b>Yup. Glad to see you're back on your feet.</b>

19:48.390 --> 19:50.920
<b>I heard you were beaten
by Imperial soldiers.</b>

19:51.420 --> 19:54.060
<b>When did she show up?</b>

19:56.320 --> 20:00.800
<b>What's this? Sorry, little girl,
but I'm not interested in you.</b>

20:01.250 --> 20:03.850
<b>Come back 40 years later.</b>

20:05.130 --> 20:07.230
<b>So you're the real one.</b>

20:07.230 --> 20:09.940
<b>I almost thought you were a fake.</b>

20:10.250 --> 20:12.150
<b>What do you mean by that?</b>

20:12.460 --> 20:13.500
<b>Your smell.</b>

20:14.480 --> 20:19.800
<b>Ever since I became a witch, I've become
very sensitive to the smell of Star Spirits.</b>

20:19.800 --> 20:23.820
<b>Your body had some weird
Star Spirit energy clinging to it,</b>

20:23.820 --> 20:25.600
<b>so I couldn't help but suspect you.</b>

20:25.910 --> 20:29.040
<b>This is a Star Spirit research facility.
That much is to be expected...</b>

20:29.040 --> 20:31.670
<b>It's the same smell I smelled
at the Lou family's villa.</b>

20:32.440 --> 20:34.550
<b>Granny, where were you today?</b>

20:34.990 --> 20:37.800
<b>I've been here in this facility
the whole time.</b>

20:39.610 --> 20:42.400
<b>Then that means they
might already be inside.</b>

20:43.250 --> 20:46.870
<b>If they're Lou family servants,
of course they'd have useful powers.</b>

20:48.480 --> 20:51.490
<b>Granny, go report to Lord Talisman.</b>

20:51.490 --> 20:52.440
<b>And...</b>

20:52.880 --> 20:55.860
<b>...to the acting head of the family,
Mizerhyby, too.</b>

20:57.030 --> 20:59.700
<b>You are misunderstanding me,
Lord Talisman.</b>

21:01.430 --> 21:04.510
<b>It's true that I said
a strong leader is necessary.</b>

21:04.510 --> 21:07.450
<b>But I never said we should
hold a Queen selection.</b>

21:09.890 --> 21:12.000
<b>We must awaken the Founder.</b>

21:12.000 --> 21:13.000
<b>What?</b>

21:13.000 --> 21:14.630
<b>What did you just say?!</b>

21:18.130 --> 21:20.460
<b>That is an option...</b>

21:20.460 --> 21:22.760
<b>If it's the Founder, then surely...</b>

21:23.170 --> 21:24.890
<b>So, what do you all think?</b>

21:24.890 --> 21:26.640
<b>Wait!</b>

21:26.640 --> 21:30.590
<b>The method to awaken the Founder
hasn't been established yet.</b>

21:30.590 --> 21:33.270
<b>And doing so carries grave risks.</b>

21:33.810 --> 21:38.400
<b>You all remember the damage
caused in the neutral city of Ein, don't you?</b>

21:40.450 --> 21:44.780
<b>The Founder is the type to harm even allies
if it means destroying the Empire...</b>

21:45.110 --> 21:48.260
<b>If the Founder's attacks target
anyone besides Imperials,</b>

21:48.260 --> 21:51.040
<b>the Sovereignty will be
condemned by the world.</b>

21:51.040 --> 21:54.540
<b>Isn't that exactly the kind of challenge
where a Queen must prove her worth?</b>

21:59.920 --> 22:01.280
<b>Did something happen?</b>

22:03.060 --> 22:05.790
<b>What is this beautiful place?</b>

22:08.480 --> 22:09.940
<b>I can hear someone...</b>

22:10.390 --> 22:12.820
<b>...breathing from inside that thing.</b>

22:14.560 --> 22:16.270
<b>Inside there...</b>

22:22.670 --> 22:24.740
<b>Is it Sisbell in there?</b>

22:24.740 --> 22:29.030
<b>From the breathing sounds,
I think it's a young woman inside.</b>

22:29.030 --> 22:30.850
<b>- So that means it's Sisbell?
- It's Lady Sisbell?!</b>

22:33.420 --> 22:34.940
<b>W-What?!</b>

22:34.940 --> 22:36.040
<b>An explosion?!</b>

22:36.530 --> 22:38.920
<b>Who is it? What are they after?</b>

22:38.920 --> 22:41.480
<b>W-We don't know either!</b>

22:41.480 --> 22:44.300
<b>This wasn't part of our mission!</b>

22:44.300 --> 22:45.510
<b>That's...</b>

22:45.950 --> 22:47.890
<b>Star Spirit energy?</b>

22:49.390 --> 22:51.760
<b>If you pull something like this
at a Hydra facility,</b>

22:51.760 --> 22:54.250
<b>you'll make an enemy of the royal family.</b>

22:54.630 --> 22:59.620
<b>Even Alice couldn't act carelessly, which is
why they approached us in the first place.</b>

23:00.460 --> 23:01.590
<b>Who are they?</b>

23:02.200 --> 23:05.400
<b>The guards have gone outside,
and the building's undefended.</b>

23:05.400 --> 23:07.870
<b>This is the perfect chance to rescue Sisbell.</b>

23:09.020 --> 23:10.410
<b>Iska!</b>

23:10.810 --> 23:11.910
<b>I'm breaking it.</b>

23:26.780 --> 23:29.350
<b>Lady Sisbell! We've come to rescue—</b>

23:42.110 --> 23:44.030
<b>Immediate execution.</b>

23:48.740 --> 23:51.700
<b>Welcome, Lou assassins.</b>

23:53.010 --> 23:56.820
<b>These are beam cannons that accumulate
Star Spirit energy and fire it.</b>

23:56.820 --> 23:58.630
<b>A total of 24 guns.</b>

23:59.250 --> 24:03.050
<b>This is a prototype of the facility,
but I guarantee its power.</b>

24:03.580 --> 24:07.760
<b>After all, it's my Star Spirit energy.</b>

24:08.080 --> 24:11.650
<b>I am Mizerhyby Hydra Nebulis IX.</b>

24:12.140 --> 24:17.370
<b>Now, witness the noblest power in the world.</b>

24:25.460 --> 24:28.300
<b>Greet them with applause and cheers.</b>
